<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@/~cl_15__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Any company which is registered as a trust company before the commencement of this Act (in this section referred to as \"the transferor\") may, on and after the commencement of this Act, transfer its business as a trust company under the principal Act to another company registered as a trust company under the principal Act as amended by this Act (in this section referred to as \"the transferee\") by making a joint application to the Court by way of an ex parte originating summons for such order bf the Court as may be required by them to facilitate or enable the agreement or arrangemerit being given effect to."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@/~cl_15__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@/~cl_15> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@> .
