<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@/~cl_15__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "The transferor shall lodge, within thirty days of the making of the order of the Court under subsection (1), an authenticated copy of such order together with an authenticated copy of the agreement or arrangement, with —"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@> .
