<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@/~cl_15__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "The Registrar, upon receipt of the documents mentioned in subsection (5), shall cancel the registration of the transferor as a trust company."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@> .
