<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@/~cl_15__subsec_7> <https://schema.org/text> "Where an order of the Court under subsection (1) vests any alienated land, or any share or interest in any alienated land, in the transferee—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@/~cl_15__subsec_7__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@/~cl_15__subsec_7> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@> .
