<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@/~cl_15__subsec_7__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "the Court shall, where such alienated land is in Peninsular Malaysia, pursuant to subsection 420(2) of the National Land Code, cause a copy of the order to be served on the Registrar of Titles or the Land Administrator, as the case may be, immediately after the making of the order so that the Registrar of Titles or the Land Administrator, as the case may be, gives effect ,to the provisions of sub- sections 420(2), (3) and (4) of the Code;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@/~cl_15__subsec_7__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@/~cl_15__subsec_7> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@/~cl_15__subsec_7__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "b" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@> .
