<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@/~cl_15__subsec_7__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "where such alienated land is in Sabah, the transferee shall, as soon as practicable, after the order has been made, present an authenticated copy of such order to the Registrar for the registration of the vesting of the alienated land or of the share or interest in alienated land as provided for under the Land Ordinance of Sabah; or Labuan Trust Companies (Amendment)"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@/~cl_15__subsec_7__para_c> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@/~cl_15__subsec_7> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@/~cl_15__subsec_7__para_c> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "c" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@> .
