<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@/~cl_16__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Any company incorporated under the Companies Act 1965 or that is registered as a foreign company under that Act and was registered as a trust company under subsection 4(1) of the principal Act immediately before the commencement of this Act shall coritinue to be registered as a trust'Company under that subsection until the transfer of its trust company business to another company registered under that subsection in accordance with the principal Act as amended by this Act. 14 Bill"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@/~cl_16__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@/~cl_16> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@/~cl_16__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@/~cl_16__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@/~cl_16__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Any inquiry, trial, or proceedings done, taken or commenced by any company incorporated under the Companies Act 1965 or that is registered as a foreign company under that Act and was registered as a trust company under subsection 4(1) immediately before the commencement of this Act may,be continued or concluded under and in accordance with the provisions of the principal Act as amended by this Act by that company or the company to which the trust company business of that company has been transferred and to which the inquiry, trial, or proceeding relates."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2002/32/eng@> .
